        "In \\ours, each coarse stage compresses the input to a shorter length.\n",
        "    $$ \\hat{N} = \\lceil \\frac{\\log K - \\log d_1}{\\log c_1 - \\log K} \\rceil$$\n",
        "\\subsection{Fine-Grained Summary Generation}\n",
        "When the input source of $D^l$ is shorter than $K$, we can proceed to the fine-grained stage. In this stage, $D^l$ is used to train a summarization model from scratch to obtain the final summary.\n",
