            "    $$ \\hat{N} = \\lceil \\frac{\\log K - \\log d_1}{\\log c_1 - \\log K} \\rceil$$\n",
            "where $d_1$ and $c_1$ are the average length of source text and coarse segments in stage 1. In Section \\ref{sec:intermedi} and Table \\ref{tab:emp}, we demonstrate this estimation is close to the empirical number of coarse stages.\n",
